WEBVTT

1
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,375
<i>WAVE</i>
TEKNOLOGI EMPAT TAK

2
00:01:09,583 --> 00:01:11,208
<i>Orang selalu bertanya</i>

3
00:01:12,625 --> 00:01:15,375
<i>apa serunya mengendarai motor.</i>

4
00:01:16,541 --> 00:01:18,416
<i>Dengan bisingnya.</i>

5
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:20,250
<i>Bahayanya.</i>

6
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:24,416
<i>Apa yang diinginkan pembalap jalanan?</i>

7
00:01:39,666 --> 00:01:40,958
<i>Apa yang kami cari?</i>

8
00:01:44,416 --> 00:01:45,958
<i>Apa yang kami inginkan?</i>

9
00:01:51,666 --> 00:01:53,625
{\an8}<i>Apa kami tak takut mati?</i>

10
00:01:58,416 --> 00:02:00,125
<i>Apa tak bosan membuat keributan?</i>

11
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:12,291
<i>Bagiku, jawabannya…</i>

12
00:02:17,250 --> 00:02:19,291
<i>Tidak. Kami tidak bosan.</i>

13
00:02:39,083 --> 00:02:42,125
<i>Cinta pertamaku adalah kecepatan.</i>

14
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:46,375
<i>Setelah menarik gas sampai tanganmu kebas,</i>

15
00:02:47,916 --> 00:02:50,875
<i>setelah kau melihat</i>
<i>bagaimana dunia menjadi kabur…</i>

16
00:02:56,791 --> 00:02:58,958
<i>semua masalahmu</i>

17
00:03:00,541 --> 00:03:01,708
<i>akan hilang.</i>

18
00:04:46,875 --> 00:04:49,916
Kalau kau tak senang, mulailah balapan!

19
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:53,583
Beri tahu bos bodohmu, Boy,

20
00:04:53,666 --> 00:04:56,083
jangan kirim anak buahnya
menggangguku malam-malam.

21
00:04:56,166 --> 00:04:59,333
Sombong sekali, ya? Kau Azam, 'kan?

22
00:04:59,416 --> 00:05:02,041
Kalau motormu sehebat itu,
tunggu apa lagi?

23
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,750
Apa aku terlihat ketakutan?

24
00:05:05,583 --> 00:05:06,833
Tunggu saja.

25
00:05:07,333 --> 00:05:09,125
Tunggu?

26
00:05:10,250 --> 00:05:11,958
Kau yang penakut, Dasar Bodoh!

27
00:05:13,166 --> 00:05:14,000
Bodoh.

28
00:05:19,416 --> 00:05:21,458
Berdiri di tengah jalan? Apa kau buta?

29
00:05:31,666 --> 00:05:33,875
Ya, aku buta. Kenapa?

30
00:05:51,833 --> 00:05:55,750
TAMAN SULTAN ISMAIL

31
00:06:10,291 --> 00:06:11,666
<i>Kau benar tinggal di sini?</i>

32
00:06:15,208 --> 00:06:18,083
Aku buta. Tidak bisa lihat.

33
00:06:19,250 --> 00:06:20,833
Bagaimana kau tahu ini flatmu?

34
00:06:20,916 --> 00:06:23,375
Bagaimana kalau aku
membawamu ke tempat lain?

35
00:06:24,125 --> 00:06:26,375
Kalau aku menjualmu? Kau tak akan tahu.

36
00:06:29,666 --> 00:06:31,416
Di sana ada parkir motor, 'kan?

37
00:06:34,958 --> 00:06:36,250
Di atas situ ada bendera.

38
00:06:37,250 --> 00:06:39,083
Kalau siang aku bisa lihat sedikit.

39
00:06:39,583 --> 00:06:40,750
Malam lebih sulit.

40
00:06:44,541 --> 00:06:45,791
Kau yang rugi.

41
00:06:45,875 --> 00:06:48,208
Kau tak bisa melihat wajah tampanku.

42
00:06:53,041 --> 00:06:54,166
Hei.

43
00:06:55,291 --> 00:06:58,500
Maaf tadi aku hampir menabrakmu.

44
00:06:58,583 --> 00:06:59,583
Tidak apa-apa.

45
00:07:00,208 --> 00:07:01,625
Terima kasih kau mengantarku pulang.

46
00:07:10,458 --> 00:07:12,625
Hei!

47
00:07:13,458 --> 00:07:14,375
Kau…

48
00:07:15,833 --> 00:07:18,166
Hampir saja.

49
00:07:23,083 --> 00:07:24,125
Pulang kerja?

50
00:07:24,625 --> 00:07:27,541
Ya. Di toko perkakas di dekat sini.

51
00:07:28,791 --> 00:07:30,750
Tapi kenapa kau mengikutiku?

52
00:07:35,125 --> 00:07:38,083
Tidak apa-apa. Aku tidak mau kau jatuh.

53
00:07:40,875 --> 00:07:42,875
Aku memakai tangga ini setiap hari.

54
00:07:49,125 --> 00:07:51,333
Orang buta bisa bekerja di toko perkakas?

55
00:07:51,833 --> 00:07:55,291
Apa? Apa kami hanya bisa
jadi tukang pijat?

56
00:07:57,125 --> 00:07:58,291
Aku cuma bertanya.

57
00:08:01,666 --> 00:08:04,625
Ratna? Kau pulang terlambat hari ini.

58
00:08:04,708 --> 00:08:06,125
Siapa ini?

59
00:08:06,208 --> 00:08:09,041
Temanku, Kak Milah. Tadi dia kecelakaan.

60
00:08:09,125 --> 00:08:12,291
Astaga. Tunggu. Aku ambilkan obat.

61
00:08:21,250 --> 00:08:22,125
Masuklah.

62
00:08:22,208 --> 00:08:24,833
Tidak, terima kasih. Aku harus pergi.

63
00:08:25,333 --> 00:08:28,208
Masuk saja. Kau bukan pembunuh, 'kan?

64
00:08:31,416 --> 00:08:32,458
Bukan.

65
00:08:41,916 --> 00:08:43,125
Namaku Azam.

66
00:08:46,041 --> 00:08:47,083
Ratna.

67
00:08:48,916 --> 00:08:50,083
Ratna…

68
00:09:02,583 --> 00:09:03,833
Jangan bergerak.

69
00:09:09,708 --> 00:09:11,333
Orang tuamu tak ada di rumah?

70
00:09:11,958 --> 00:09:13,666
Ayahku di Johor Bahru.

71
00:09:14,333 --> 00:09:15,625
Ibuku sudah meninggal.

72
00:09:20,375 --> 00:09:22,166
Kau tak takut sendirian?

73
00:09:23,291 --> 00:09:25,500
Mungkin ada hantu. Atau <i>Orang Minyak.</i>

74
00:09:37,416 --> 00:09:39,375
Baiklah. Selesai.

75
00:09:40,583 --> 00:09:41,625
Terima kasih.

76
00:10:00,958 --> 00:10:02,416
Jimmy. Ada apa?

77
00:10:03,125 --> 00:10:05,708
<i>Tak bisakah kau angkat telepon?</i>

78
00:10:06,208 --> 00:10:08,041
<i>Pipanya sudah terpasang.</i>
<i>Selesai malam ini.</i>

79
00:10:08,125 --> 00:10:09,250
Serius?

80
00:10:09,333 --> 00:10:11,708
- <i>Cepatlah!</i>
- Tunggu. Aku segera ke sana.

81
00:10:12,666 --> 00:10:13,583
Ratna.

82
00:10:14,458 --> 00:10:16,666
Aku harus pergi sekarang.

83
00:10:18,333 --> 00:10:19,333
Terima kasih.

84
00:10:19,916 --> 00:10:21,958
Kau sudah mengobatiku dan semuanya.

85
00:10:22,458 --> 00:10:24,541
Ya. Terima kasih.

86
00:10:26,458 --> 00:10:27,416
Asalamualaikum.

87
00:10:44,541 --> 00:10:45,375
Azam!

88
00:10:52,125 --> 00:10:53,166
Ada apa?

89
00:10:57,750 --> 00:10:58,833
Bukan apa-apa.

90
00:11:04,625 --> 00:11:06,500
- Nol satu tujuh…
- Tunggu!

91
00:11:09,375 --> 00:11:13,000
Dua tujuh tujuh, nenek jatuh dari surga.

92
00:11:15,375 --> 00:11:16,750
Ayolah.

93
00:11:17,250 --> 00:11:19,291
- Tidak usah.
- Mau atau tidak?

94
00:11:19,375 --> 00:11:21,041
Tentu saja mau.

95
00:11:21,125 --> 00:11:23,708
Baiklah. Hari ini akan jadi

96
00:11:23,791 --> 00:11:28,833
hari terakhir dan final
untuk obral knalpot Red Leo.

97
00:11:28,916 --> 00:11:31,833
Perhatikan baik-baik.
Akan kutunjukkan padamu.

98
00:11:31,916 --> 00:11:34,333
Satu hal lagi.
Kalau kalian membeli hari ini,

99
00:11:35,125 --> 00:11:36,291
dapat stiker gratis.

100
00:11:36,375 --> 00:11:38,833
Besok tidak ada lagi.

101
00:11:38,916 --> 00:11:39,750
{\an8}- HABISLAH KAU!
- KALAU BERANI BALAPAN!

102
00:11:39,833 --> 00:11:41,416
Baiklah. Aku harus pergi.

103
00:11:41,500 --> 00:11:44,250
Kalau ada apa-apa, <i>DM</i> aku.

104
00:11:44,333 --> 00:11:46,083
Langsung saja!

105
00:11:47,333 --> 00:11:49,833
Sudah cukup dengan itu.

106
00:11:51,083 --> 00:11:52,000
Hei.

107
00:11:52,500 --> 00:11:54,500
Kau hanya kuli di bengkel ini.

108
00:11:55,583 --> 00:11:56,875
Bantu perbaiki motor ini.

109
00:12:00,291 --> 00:12:01,375
Azam.

110
00:12:02,375 --> 00:12:05,791
Anak buah Boy marah.
Kau bilang apa pada Kutu?

111
00:12:05,875 --> 00:12:07,958
Aku lihat komentar di siaran langsungku.

112
00:12:08,458 --> 00:12:10,541
Biarkan mereka berkata apa pun.

113
00:12:10,625 --> 00:12:12,000
Apa yang kita tunggu?

114
00:12:12,916 --> 00:12:14,125
Ayo.

115
00:12:19,416 --> 00:12:22,041
- Bersedia?
- Tunjukkan.

116
00:12:22,125 --> 00:12:26,416
Mengumumkan kedatangan Yang Mulia…

117
00:12:39,833 --> 00:12:41,541
Astaga!

118
00:12:56,458 --> 00:12:57,500
Azam.

119
00:12:58,458 --> 00:12:59,916
Kau yakin mau balapan dengan ini?

120
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,375
Sayang sekali.

121
00:13:01,875 --> 00:13:05,791
Kalau kau menjualnya, bisa dapat
sekitar RM20.000 sampai RM30.000.

122
00:13:06,666 --> 00:13:09,750
Kau tahu betapa buruk
balap ilegal ini, 'kan?

123
00:13:10,250 --> 00:13:12,333
Kalau terjadi apa-apa, kau akan mati.

124
00:13:12,416 --> 00:13:13,541
Ayolah.

125
00:13:13,625 --> 00:13:15,416
Bilang saja kau mau balapan.

126
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:17,875
Dasar botak!

127
00:13:17,958 --> 00:13:19,500
Diamlah.

128
00:13:20,416 --> 00:13:21,416
Jimmy.

129
00:13:22,041 --> 00:13:25,458
Aku tak akan mati selama
kita belum mencapai target.

130
00:13:26,666 --> 00:13:29,458
Berapa lama kau akan
memakai Kriss milik ibumu?

131
00:13:29,541 --> 00:13:32,625
Melakukan pengiriman sepanjang hari
dan ke bengkel di malam hari.

132
00:13:32,708 --> 00:13:34,583
Memperbaiki motor.

133
00:13:34,666 --> 00:13:36,291
Mau berapa lama?

134
00:13:36,375 --> 00:13:39,416
Jimmy, biaya kuliah adik perempuannya

135
00:13:39,500 --> 00:13:43,375
hampir RM40.000. Mahal sekali!

136
00:13:45,208 --> 00:13:48,791
Bukankah kau pernah bilang padaku
suatu hari nanti

137
00:13:48,875 --> 00:13:50,916
kau akan punya bengkelmu sendiri?

138
00:13:51,416 --> 00:13:53,125
Mat Jet Motorsport.

139
00:13:53,625 --> 00:13:56,750
Berapa lama kau mau bekerja
sebagai mekanik di sini, Mat Jet?

140
00:13:57,625 --> 00:14:01,166
Intinya, kalau kita memulai balapan,

141
00:14:01,666 --> 00:14:05,041
kita hanya perlu memenangkan RM20.000
tiga hingga empat kali.

142
00:14:05,666 --> 00:14:09,416
Aku yakin semua masalahmu

143
00:14:09,500 --> 00:14:11,791
dan masalah Mat Jet akan selesai.

144
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,208
Bahkan masalahku juga.

145
00:14:18,333 --> 00:14:19,291
Jadi,

146
00:14:19,791 --> 00:14:21,666
itulah target kita.

147
00:14:21,750 --> 00:14:22,958
Percayalah padaku.

148
00:14:24,250 --> 00:14:25,500
Motor ini…

149
00:14:27,583 --> 00:14:29,166
akan mengubah hidup kita.

150
00:14:30,291 --> 00:14:31,375
Percayalah.

151
00:14:44,041 --> 00:14:46,041
Mat Jet, bantulah Jimmy.

152
00:15:01,708 --> 00:15:04,166
PERMATA PIALA PRIX
HARAPAN MALAYSIA

153
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:10,666
Along, apa yang kau lakukan? Bangun.

154
00:15:10,750 --> 00:15:12,208
Bangunlah!

155
00:15:12,708 --> 00:15:14,750
Bangunlah. Duduk di sana.

156
00:15:14,833 --> 00:15:16,583
Kenapa kau makan seperti ini.

157
00:15:20,250 --> 00:15:21,333
Duduk di sini.

158
00:15:25,750 --> 00:15:28,583
Apa ini? Kau membuat berantakan.

159
00:15:28,666 --> 00:15:31,583
Sudah kubilang, kalau mau makan
beri tahu aku.

160
00:15:31,666 --> 00:15:33,375
Akan aku ambilkan.

161
00:15:35,333 --> 00:15:36,208
Angah.

162
00:15:37,791 --> 00:15:40,666
Angah, apa kau tak punya uang?

163
00:15:40,750 --> 00:15:41,625
Apa pun?

164
00:15:43,875 --> 00:15:44,750
Apa maksudmu?

165
00:15:44,833 --> 00:15:47,916
Pinjami aku uang, Angah.

166
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:49,000
Sedikit saja.

167
00:15:50,458 --> 00:15:52,208
Kalau kau mau membeli narkoba,

168
00:15:52,291 --> 00:15:54,583
kau bisa minta padaku seribu kali,

169
00:15:54,666 --> 00:15:57,916
atau menangis darah sekalipun,
tak akan kuberi.

170
00:15:59,541 --> 00:16:02,541
Angah.

171
00:16:05,625 --> 00:16:06,708
Angah.

172
00:16:20,500 --> 00:16:22,791
Karena aku kasihan padamu

173
00:16:24,541 --> 00:16:26,083
aku berjanji padamu

174
00:16:29,291 --> 00:16:30,833
kita akan pergi dari sini.

175
00:16:55,458 --> 00:16:56,458
Arash baik-baik saja?

176
00:16:57,125 --> 00:16:59,875
Siapa yang tahu?
Aku tak mau memikirkannya.

177
00:17:00,375 --> 00:17:01,458
Itu melelahkan.

178
00:17:02,125 --> 00:17:05,041
Tidak usah dipikirkan.
Kita pikirkan saja ini.

179
00:17:07,208 --> 00:17:08,708
Dari mana kau dapat ini?

180
00:17:09,541 --> 00:17:10,458
Ibu menemukannya.

181
00:17:11,041 --> 00:17:13,750
- Kau terlihat sama saja.
- Tidak menua.

182
00:17:16,625 --> 00:17:17,750
Azam.

183
00:17:20,041 --> 00:17:22,833
Kalau kau benar-benar
mau balapan dengan motor itu,

184
00:17:24,791 --> 00:17:26,250
bagaimana kalau aku ikut kau?

185
00:17:27,791 --> 00:17:30,041
Maksudku, kalau kita balapan bersama,

186
00:17:30,541 --> 00:17:32,333
makin cepat kita mencapai target.

187
00:17:35,125 --> 00:17:37,375
Kau masih kurang hati-hati
saat injak kopling.

188
00:17:38,041 --> 00:17:41,541
Aku bukan mengkritikmu.
Kau tahu kau belum mahir melakukannya.

189
00:17:42,125 --> 00:17:46,041
Kau tahu bahayanya itu. Tidak usah.

190
00:17:47,583 --> 00:17:51,208
Hanya saja, kau melakukan
semuanya sendiri.

191
00:17:51,291 --> 00:17:52,708
Ingat ucapan kita dulu?

192
00:17:52,791 --> 00:17:54,625
Kita akan menaklukkan KL bersama.

193
00:17:56,458 --> 00:17:58,750
Tapi itu zaman kita balapan sepeda.

194
00:17:58,833 --> 00:18:01,500
Ayolah, Bung. Sampai besok.

195
00:18:02,166 --> 00:18:03,250
Dadah.

196
00:18:20,291 --> 00:18:21,416
MAAF AKU BUTA, TEKAN BEL UNTUK BAYAR

197
00:18:31,291 --> 00:18:33,375
- Berapa?
- Semuanya RM40.

198
00:18:34,125 --> 00:18:35,125
Tunggu.

199
00:18:36,875 --> 00:18:39,125
<i>Diterima. RM40.</i>

200
00:18:39,208 --> 00:18:40,791
- Terima kasih.
- Sama-sama.

201
00:19:03,041 --> 00:19:04,125
- Hei!
- Tidak apa…

202
00:19:04,208 --> 00:19:07,583
Tenanglah. Ini aku. Azam.

203
00:19:08,500 --> 00:19:09,708
Apa yang kau gambar itu?

204
00:19:10,750 --> 00:19:12,000
Sedang apa kau di sini?

205
00:19:12,750 --> 00:19:14,208
Jangan marah.

206
00:19:14,875 --> 00:19:16,000
Apa aku mengganggumu?

207
00:19:18,125 --> 00:19:22,166
Aku ke sini mau mengajakmu makan siang.

208
00:19:25,166 --> 00:19:26,333
Selesai kerja jam berapa?

209
00:19:28,291 --> 00:19:29,583
Sebentar lagi.

210
00:19:44,916 --> 00:19:46,083
Apa yang kau lihat?

211
00:19:46,791 --> 00:19:49,083
Biasanya orang kencan naik mobil, 'kan?

212
00:19:49,166 --> 00:19:52,291
Ayolah. Jangan jadi anak nakal.

213
00:19:54,083 --> 00:19:55,333
Hei.

214
00:19:55,416 --> 00:19:56,416
Tunggu.

215
00:20:05,166 --> 00:20:06,708
Kirim foto pada Kak Milah.

216
00:20:08,291 --> 00:20:10,875
Kak Milah, aku keluar dengan Azam.

217
00:20:10,958 --> 00:20:12,250
Aku akan pulang terlambat.

218
00:20:13,250 --> 00:20:15,083
Kak Milah cemas
kalau aku terlambat pulang.

219
00:20:15,916 --> 00:20:16,833
Baiklah.

220
00:20:26,833 --> 00:20:28,458
Ini bukan motor hari itu, ya?

221
00:20:29,166 --> 00:20:30,166
Bukan.

222
00:20:31,625 --> 00:20:33,291
Tegakkan kepala untuk pakai helm.

223
00:20:38,875 --> 00:20:40,041
Baik.

224
00:20:40,666 --> 00:20:41,500
Naiklah.

225
00:20:52,583 --> 00:20:54,375
Motor yang hari itu lebih imut.

226
00:20:55,916 --> 00:20:58,666
Tapi yang ini lebih bising!

227
00:21:03,083 --> 00:21:04,166
Siap?

228
00:21:16,500 --> 00:21:17,958
Jadi, kau suka melukis?

229
00:21:19,500 --> 00:21:21,916
Dan kau? Balap jalanan?

230
00:21:23,750 --> 00:21:26,750
Aku bisa mengenalinya dari suara motormu.

231
00:21:32,416 --> 00:21:33,458
Kenapa?

232
00:21:35,208 --> 00:21:36,458
Kau benci pembalap jalanan?

233
00:21:37,833 --> 00:21:38,875
Tidak sama sekali.

234
00:21:39,625 --> 00:21:43,583
Aku selalu dengar di berita. Berkendara
dengan kecepatan tinggi itu berbahaya.

235
00:21:46,875 --> 00:21:48,000
Entahlah.

236
00:21:51,958 --> 00:21:54,541
Kau tak akan paham meski kujelaskan.

237
00:21:58,000 --> 00:21:59,125
Tak paham juga tak apa.

238
00:22:00,208 --> 00:22:01,500
Sekadar tahu saja cukup.

239
00:22:11,208 --> 00:22:12,916
Dulu kakak laki-lakiku pembalap.

240
00:22:14,916 --> 00:22:16,916
Secara legal maupun ilegal.

241
00:22:20,666 --> 00:22:22,750
Orang tuaku meninggal waktu aku kecil.

242
00:22:25,041 --> 00:22:28,166
Jadi, kakakku menjadi waliku.

243
00:22:29,166 --> 00:22:30,708
Tapi itu dulu.

244
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:34,333
Setelah kecelakaannya,

245
00:22:37,291 --> 00:22:38,541
dia mulai pakai narkoba.

246
00:22:40,750 --> 00:22:42,125
Sekarang dia berbeda.

247
00:22:47,666 --> 00:22:51,375
Tapi intinya, aku harus balapan.

248
00:22:51,458 --> 00:22:54,958
Itu satu-satunya cara bagi orang sepertiku
untuk mendapatkan uang.

249
00:22:59,125 --> 00:23:03,041
Kau tahu, mendiang ayahku
punya rumah di Perlis.

250
00:23:04,250 --> 00:23:06,375
Kalau aku punya cukup uang,

251
00:23:06,875 --> 00:23:08,708
aku ingin memperbaiki rumah itu.

252
00:23:10,708 --> 00:23:12,291
Aku akan membawa Arash ke sana.

253
00:23:13,291 --> 00:23:14,583
Jauh dari KL.

254
00:23:30,125 --> 00:23:31,875
Naiklah ke motor. Pakailah helmmu.

255
00:23:36,833 --> 00:23:37,958
Boy.

256
00:23:49,500 --> 00:23:52,875
Kutu, apa ini orang yang membicarakanku?

257
00:23:52,958 --> 00:23:53,791
Orang yang sama.

258
00:23:54,625 --> 00:23:58,375
Boy, apa orang tuamu mengizinkanmu
pulang selarut ini?

259
00:24:01,541 --> 00:24:06,125
Apa kau pikir Boy takut
dengan motor barumu ini?

260
00:24:07,666 --> 00:24:09,791
Dia yang takut. Bukan aku.

261
00:24:11,916 --> 00:24:13,166
Aku mau balapan.

262
00:24:15,541 --> 00:24:16,583
Lima puluh.

263
00:24:17,291 --> 00:24:19,166
Lima puluh ribu?

264
00:24:20,333 --> 00:24:22,000
Kau pikir aku bodoh?

265
00:24:22,791 --> 00:24:24,958
Balapan saja dengan keluargamu, Boy.

266
00:24:25,791 --> 00:24:27,708
Kau tidak sepertiku. Kau punya ayah.

267
00:24:28,208 --> 00:24:30,458
Aku tidak punya. Ayahku sudah mati.

268
00:24:31,458 --> 00:24:33,958
Kau bisa minta uang dari ayahmu.
Kau tahu kenapa?

269
00:24:34,041 --> 00:24:35,541
Karena ayahmu bodoh.

270
00:24:37,041 --> 00:24:38,208
Sama sepertimu!

271
00:24:43,333 --> 00:24:45,958
Boy, kau tak bisa mengabaikannya.

272
00:24:48,708 --> 00:24:50,416
Apa yang kalian tunggu? Kejar dia!

273
00:24:52,541 --> 00:24:55,250
Hei, Zahar. Naik motormu, Bodoh!

274
00:25:20,958 --> 00:25:22,250
Siapa orang-orang itu?

275
00:25:22,833 --> 00:25:24,125
Apa mau mereka?

276
00:25:25,125 --> 00:25:28,125
Bukan apa-apa, Ratna. Hanya orang bodoh.

277
00:25:29,208 --> 00:25:30,458
Jangan khawatir, ya?

278
00:25:31,416 --> 00:25:35,083
Kalau terjadi apa pun,
aku akan melindungimu. Ya?

279
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:14,291
Hei, Jimmy. Kenapa kau berbaring?

280
00:26:15,250 --> 00:26:16,958
Siapa yang mengerjakan motornya?

281
00:26:17,458 --> 00:26:18,583
Apa?

282
00:26:18,666 --> 00:26:21,125
Aku pergi dari Dengkil ke Gombak,

283
00:26:21,208 --> 00:26:23,458
lalu kembali ke Cheras
melakukan pengiriman.

284
00:26:24,041 --> 00:26:25,750
Kriss milik ibuku ini sudah kritis.

285
00:26:26,416 --> 00:26:27,583
Beri aku sedikit ruang.

286
00:26:35,208 --> 00:26:37,333
<i>Aku mencari RXZ warna ungu.</i>

287
00:26:37,416 --> 00:26:39,791
<i>Nomor pelat, KEU 51.</i>

288
00:26:40,291 --> 00:26:41,791
Azam membuat masalah.

289
00:26:41,875 --> 00:26:44,000
<i>Bajingan ini bernama Azam.</i>

290
00:26:44,583 --> 00:26:45,916
{\an8}<i>Dia punya bengkel.</i>

291
00:26:46,000 --> 00:26:49,125
{\an8}<i>Temukan itu, aku akan beri kalian bonus.</i>
<i>Bagaimana?</i>

292
00:26:52,625 --> 00:26:53,958
Telepon Azam.

293
00:27:04,000 --> 00:27:05,583
Sekarang apa?

294
00:27:10,708 --> 00:27:11,833
Ini.

295
00:27:16,250 --> 00:27:17,375
Ya!

296
00:27:17,458 --> 00:27:19,208
Sekarang lebih baik. Ini.

297
00:27:19,291 --> 00:27:21,083
Tidak usah. Simpan saja.

298
00:27:24,291 --> 00:27:25,666
Ini.

299
00:27:32,791 --> 00:27:33,625
Peluit.

300
00:27:35,291 --> 00:27:39,041
Kalau seseorang mengganggumu
atau kau jatuh atau semacamnya,

301
00:27:39,125 --> 00:27:42,000
tiup saja peluitnya,
dan aku akan segera datang.

302
00:27:44,333 --> 00:27:46,208
Ya, seperti itu.

303
00:27:46,291 --> 00:27:47,583
Aku bisa menjadi wasit.

304
00:27:47,666 --> 00:27:49,666
Kau juga bisa menunjukkan kartu kuning.

305
00:27:52,291 --> 00:27:53,291
Terima kasih, Azam.

306
00:27:54,291 --> 00:27:55,583
Aku harus pergi.

307
00:27:56,666 --> 00:27:57,833
Hati-hati.

308
00:28:01,041 --> 00:28:02,083
Selamat malam.

309
00:28:06,500 --> 00:28:07,458
Azam.

310
00:28:08,916 --> 00:28:10,333
Ini bukan kencan, 'kan?

311
00:28:11,666 --> 00:28:13,583
Kalau kencan, harus pakai mobil, 'kan?

312
00:28:15,916 --> 00:28:17,583
Baiklah. Selamat tinggal!

313
00:28:18,500 --> 00:28:19,541
Selamat tinggal.

314
00:28:37,541 --> 00:28:39,875
- Mat Jet.
- <i>Kau tuli tak dengar dering telepon?</i>

315
00:28:40,375 --> 00:28:43,208
Aku tadi naik motor. Diamlah.

316
00:28:43,291 --> 00:28:45,166
- Ada apa?
- <i>Pulanglah sekarang.</i>

317
00:28:45,250 --> 00:28:47,125
<i>Rumahmu dikepung.</i>

318
00:28:49,333 --> 00:28:50,708
Tunggu aku sampai.

319
00:29:03,875 --> 00:29:07,291
Asalamualaikum!

320
00:29:07,375 --> 00:29:11,041
Azam? Azam!

321
00:29:13,625 --> 00:29:15,916
Jet, kalau Azam tidak sampai
dalam 10 menit,

322
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:17,250
telepon saja polisi.

323
00:29:17,333 --> 00:29:21,083
Kenapa kita harus memanggil polisi?
Ayo kita lawan saja mereka!

324
00:29:22,625 --> 00:29:24,541
Dasar bodoh!

325
00:29:25,208 --> 00:29:28,250
Boy pernah memukuli anak Cheras.
Dia dirawat di ICU sebulan!

326
00:29:34,708 --> 00:29:38,958
Bodoh sekali!

327
00:29:39,458 --> 00:29:41,333
Makan saja kuacimu.

328
00:29:41,916 --> 00:29:43,708
Ini konyol!

329
00:29:47,916 --> 00:29:50,583
Kutu, apa kau sedang menunggu wahyu?

330
00:29:52,750 --> 00:29:54,000
Baiklah, Ketua.

331
00:30:09,458 --> 00:30:10,625
Kalian banyak sekali!

332
00:30:11,125 --> 00:30:12,541
Jimmy! Mat Jet!

333
00:30:13,333 --> 00:30:15,291
Ada apa ini? Ada acara?

334
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:17,333
Boy.

335
00:30:17,416 --> 00:30:20,250
Kalau kau merindukanku,
tak perlu mencariku ke rumah.

336
00:30:22,125 --> 00:30:24,625
Kau tahu, 'kan?
Aku hanya perlu menjentikkan jari,

337
00:30:24,708 --> 00:30:26,416
dan kau akan hancur.

338
00:30:28,000 --> 00:30:30,958
Aku tahu. Tapi anjing-anjingmu ini keren.

339
00:30:31,625 --> 00:30:33,000
Berapa gajimu?

340
00:30:33,625 --> 00:30:35,208
Apa dapat SOCSO juga?

341
00:30:36,000 --> 00:30:38,791
Lebih baik daripada anak buahmu.

342
00:30:40,416 --> 00:30:42,458
Tak punya nyali.

343
00:30:43,291 --> 00:30:44,291
Akhir pekan berikutnya.

344
00:30:45,166 --> 00:30:48,041
RXZ Open. RM100.000.

345
00:30:51,583 --> 00:30:54,000
Baik. Aku janji akan datang.

346
00:30:54,083 --> 00:30:56,458
Ya? Kalian berdua, ingatlan wajahku.

347
00:30:56,541 --> 00:30:58,458
Tapi kita jual kakak perempuanmu dulu.

348
00:30:59,500 --> 00:31:02,625
Santai, Boy. Ini bisa didiskusikan.

349
00:31:19,833 --> 00:31:22,791
Hei, Miskin. Kau pikir aku peduli?

350
00:31:22,875 --> 00:31:24,416
Kau hanya pembalap kampung.

351
00:31:25,208 --> 00:31:29,166
Orang menghormatimu
karena kau adiknya Arash.

352
00:31:29,666 --> 00:31:31,208
Tapi apa yang terjadi padanya?

353
00:31:32,208 --> 00:31:33,458
Dia itu pecandu, ya?

354
00:31:33,958 --> 00:31:35,125
Hanya bajingan, 'kan?

355
00:31:36,333 --> 00:31:37,666
Datanglah ke balapan,

356
00:31:40,125 --> 00:31:42,625
atau aku akan membunuh pecandu itu.

357
00:31:59,375 --> 00:32:00,583
Sekarang apa, Azam?

358
00:32:01,791 --> 00:32:03,541
Apa maksudmu "sekarang apa"?

359
00:32:04,250 --> 00:32:06,875
Kalian sama sekali tak membantu
saat aku dipukuli.

360
00:32:07,500 --> 00:32:09,833
Kurasa kita harus meninggalkan KL.

361
00:32:11,250 --> 00:32:13,166
Di mana kita bisa dapat RM100.000?

362
00:32:17,208 --> 00:32:18,708
Bagaimana kalau aku menang?

363
00:32:19,208 --> 00:32:20,833
Kalau kau menang.

364
00:32:21,583 --> 00:32:22,750
Kalau tidak?

365
00:32:23,416 --> 00:32:24,875
Kau akan menjadi budak.

366
00:32:24,958 --> 00:32:27,000
Aku percaya diri akan menang.

367
00:32:27,083 --> 00:32:29,208
Aku tak mau kau menyesalinya.

368
00:32:33,208 --> 00:32:34,250
Jet.

369
00:32:35,833 --> 00:32:37,125
Pakailah uang bengkel.

370
00:32:37,708 --> 00:32:39,291
Apa kau serius?

371
00:32:39,375 --> 00:32:42,791
Aku tak keberatan,
tapi itu tetap tidak cukup.

372
00:32:43,541 --> 00:32:44,958
Aku punya tabungan.

373
00:32:46,333 --> 00:32:48,791
Masukkan juga tabunganmu, itu akan cukup.

374
00:32:48,875 --> 00:32:50,875
Tabunganku tidak banyak, Azam.

375
00:32:51,583 --> 00:32:53,166
Apa lagi Mat Jet.

376
00:33:02,083 --> 00:33:03,416
Motornya juga.

377
00:33:11,583 --> 00:33:12,666
Apa pendapat kalian?

378
00:33:16,791 --> 00:33:17,875
PERBAIKAN RUMAH AYAH

379
00:33:17,958 --> 00:33:19,750
ATAP RM7.000, EMPAT PINTU RM2.500,
KABEL RM5.000

380
00:33:19,833 --> 00:33:21,500
PIPA RM4.000 - LANTAI RM10.000

381
00:33:21,583 --> 00:33:23,041
TAGIHAN RUMAH SAKIT ARASH RM20.000

382
00:33:28,416 --> 00:33:29,500
<i>Akhir pekan berikutnya.</i>

383
00:33:29,583 --> 00:33:32,583
RXZ Open. RM100.000.

384
00:33:33,083 --> 00:33:35,833
Kalau kau kalah, kau akan jadi budak.

385
00:34:06,083 --> 00:34:07,291
Dari mana dapat uang?

386
00:34:10,000 --> 00:34:11,500
Apa kau menjual tropimu?

387
00:34:12,958 --> 00:34:14,875
Kau menjualnya, 'kan? Aku tanya padamu!

388
00:34:14,958 --> 00:34:17,833
- Bangun!
- Kakiku sakit. Kakiku sakit!

389
00:34:17,916 --> 00:34:20,750
- Kau menjual tropimu, 'kan?
- Tidak…

390
00:34:20,833 --> 00:34:22,125
Bagaimana bisa kau menjualnya?

391
00:34:22,208 --> 00:34:24,041
Apa kau bodoh?

392
00:34:24,125 --> 00:34:25,791
Diamlah, Bajingan!

393
00:34:25,875 --> 00:34:27,375
Kau yang bajingan!

394
00:34:29,583 --> 00:34:31,916
Pikirmu kau sangat hebat?

395
00:34:32,000 --> 00:34:33,916
Sangat hebat sampai bisa mengguruiku?

396
00:34:34,000 --> 00:34:36,500
Aku merawatmu.

397
00:34:41,083 --> 00:34:43,416
Kau dan aku tak ada bedanya.

398
00:34:43,916 --> 00:34:46,958
Apa katamu? Ulangi lagi, Along.

399
00:34:48,916 --> 00:34:50,541
Ulangi itu. Kau bilang apa?

400
00:34:52,916 --> 00:34:54,416
Apa bedanya?

401
00:34:54,916 --> 00:34:57,625
Antara kau balapan ilegal
dan aku pakai narkoba?

402
00:35:07,875 --> 00:35:09,041
Katakan.

403
00:35:09,958 --> 00:35:12,916
Hal yang kau lakukan itu bisa membunuhmu.

404
00:35:13,791 --> 00:35:15,958
Hal yang kulakukan ini bisa membunuhku.

405
00:35:16,458 --> 00:35:17,750
Sama saja, Angah.

406
00:35:18,458 --> 00:35:21,750
Aku harus balapan.

407
00:35:21,833 --> 00:35:23,500
Aku harus mencari uang.

408
00:35:23,583 --> 00:35:26,708
Agar aku bisa memperbaiki
rumah Ayah di desa!

409
00:35:27,208 --> 00:35:28,333
Kau tak bisa berpikir?

410
00:35:28,416 --> 00:35:32,166
Teman-temanmu yang bodoh itu
tak akan bisa menemukanmu lagi!

411
00:35:32,250 --> 00:35:36,000
Kau akan sehat kembali.
Kau bisa paham itu?

412
00:35:38,083 --> 00:35:39,000
Sehat?

413
00:35:40,041 --> 00:35:41,333
Sehat, ya?

414
00:35:41,416 --> 00:35:43,375
Apa aku bilang ingin sehat?

415
00:35:43,875 --> 00:35:45,916
Apa aku bilang begitu, Angah?

416
00:35:46,708 --> 00:35:48,083
Aku hanya mau barangku.

417
00:35:48,166 --> 00:35:52,583
Ini. Aku hanya mau barangku!

418
00:35:52,666 --> 00:35:53,750
Apa kau mengerti?

419
00:35:56,000 --> 00:35:57,583
Sial.

420
00:36:10,250 --> 00:36:11,583
Along.

421
00:36:13,208 --> 00:36:14,541
Aku lelah.

422
00:36:16,250 --> 00:36:20,250
Aku muak memikul beban sepertimu.

423
00:36:24,208 --> 00:36:25,791
Mulai sekarang,

424
00:36:26,833 --> 00:36:29,041
kau bukan lagi kakakku.

425
00:36:33,250 --> 00:36:34,375
Angah.

426
00:36:36,875 --> 00:36:38,750
Anjing kampung seperti kita?

427
00:36:40,041 --> 00:36:44,166
Sampai mampus akan menyusahkan orang.

428
00:36:46,458 --> 00:36:47,875
Kau ingat itu.

429
00:36:55,500 --> 00:36:57,166
Habis tumpah, Angah.

430
00:37:46,541 --> 00:37:47,708
Jet.

431
00:37:47,791 --> 00:37:50,375
Kalau Azam kalah, kau mau pergi ke mana?

432
00:37:52,000 --> 00:37:55,416
Mereka bilang tiket ke Maladewa
saat ini sedang murah.

433
00:37:57,458 --> 00:37:58,625
Mau apa di Maladewa?

434
00:37:59,375 --> 00:38:00,458
Menjadi mekanik.

435
00:38:00,958 --> 00:38:02,125
Bodoh.

436
00:38:02,625 --> 00:38:03,791
Mekanik?

437
00:38:03,875 --> 00:38:06,458
- Hei, Azam.
- Azam…

438
00:38:06,541 --> 00:38:08,916
Aku sudah menyiapkan motor ini seminggu.

439
00:38:09,000 --> 00:38:10,791
Kondisinya sempurna.

440
00:38:28,750 --> 00:38:29,958
Baiklah.

441
00:38:30,041 --> 00:38:31,250
Azam.

442
00:38:31,333 --> 00:38:34,416
Lebih baik lakukan uji berkendara
daripada bertemu pacarmu.

443
00:38:35,291 --> 00:38:36,791
Balapannya malam ini.

444
00:38:36,875 --> 00:38:39,166
Aku tahu. Motornya sudah siap, 'kan?

445
00:38:40,916 --> 00:38:42,041
Sampai nanti malam.

446
00:38:52,791 --> 00:38:54,458
Jangan lupa nanti malam!

447
00:39:04,625 --> 00:39:06,916
Firasatku buruk soal ini.

448
00:39:09,833 --> 00:39:11,666
Jadi, tiket ke Maladewa murah?

449
00:39:13,000 --> 00:39:14,041
Kenapa?

450
00:39:14,541 --> 00:39:16,583
Sudah kubilang, Dasar Bodoh!

451
00:39:37,041 --> 00:39:37,958
Siapa kau?

452
00:39:39,041 --> 00:39:40,125
Di mana Ratna?

453
00:39:55,041 --> 00:39:56,083
Azam, ya?

454
00:39:57,250 --> 00:39:58,166
Ya.

455
00:39:58,833 --> 00:40:00,375
Kau ajak Ratna naik motor?

456
00:40:02,166 --> 00:40:03,125
Ya.

457
00:40:07,833 --> 00:40:09,166
Aku tidak keberatan.

458
00:40:11,333 --> 00:40:12,458
Tapi…

459
00:40:13,875 --> 00:40:15,291
Bisa kau membantuku?

460
00:40:16,708 --> 00:40:18,000
Membantumu?

461
00:40:19,375 --> 00:40:21,791
Tolong bujuk Ratna untuk pulang.

462
00:40:25,166 --> 00:40:26,375
Tapi kenapa?

463
00:40:27,791 --> 00:40:29,375
Kenapa kau tak tinggal dengannya?

464
00:40:36,083 --> 00:40:40,416
{\an8}<i>Malam itu adalah kesalahan terbesar</i>
<i>dalam hidupku.</i>

465
00:40:43,500 --> 00:40:45,833
- Ambilkan obatku.
- Ibu?

466
00:40:49,250 --> 00:40:50,083
Ibu?

467
00:40:57,000 --> 00:40:58,333
Ibu?

468
00:41:00,125 --> 00:41:03,250
Ibu, bangun.

469
00:41:07,500 --> 00:41:08,666
<i>Aku membuat kesalahan</i>

470
00:41:09,666 --> 00:41:11,958
<i>dengan tidak merawat istri dan putriku.</i>

471
00:41:13,208 --> 00:41:15,166
Ratna tidak mau memaafkanku.

472
00:41:17,958 --> 00:41:19,625
Tapi mungkin kau bisa membantuku.

473
00:41:31,541 --> 00:41:32,791
Ratna.

474
00:41:36,583 --> 00:41:37,500
Ratna.

475
00:41:39,875 --> 00:41:40,916
Ratna.

476
00:41:42,583 --> 00:41:43,875
Ratna!

477
00:41:43,958 --> 00:41:46,833
Pak, tidak apa-apa. Aku akan menemuinya.

478
00:41:46,916 --> 00:41:48,791
- Ratna.
- Biar aku saja.

479
00:41:48,875 --> 00:41:50,166
Dia putriku.

480
00:41:51,166 --> 00:41:53,041
Maaf aku harus bilang begini.

481
