Kenapa kau tertawa?

728
01:10:47,833 --> 01:10:50,333
JIMMY DUA PANGGILAN

729
01:10:54,875 --> 01:10:55,708
{\an8}PILIH SIM UNTUK PANGGILAN INI

730
01:10:55,791 --> 01:10:57,333
MEMANGGIL JIMMY

731
01:11:40,500 --> 01:11:41,583
Arash.

732
01:11:50,000 --> 01:11:51,041
Arash.

733
01:11:54,333 --> 01:11:56,583
Arash, jangan main-main. Bangun.

734
01:11:57,708 --> 01:11:58,541
Arash.

735
01:12:00,625 --> 01:12:01,583
Along.

736
01:12:07,083 --> 01:12:08,541
Along, bangun.

737
01:12:10,041 --> 01:12:11,666
Jangan main-main denganku.

738
01:12:25,583 --> 01:12:27,541
Bangun, Along. Kumohon.

739
01:13:33,041 --> 01:13:34,250
Turut berduka, Azam.

740
01:13:36,500 --> 01:13:38,458
Jet, apa yang terjadi?

741
01:13:38,958 --> 01:13:40,375
Boy kirim salam.

742
01:13:42,125 --> 01:13:43,125
Azam.

743
01:13:43,208 --> 01:13:44,291
Dokter bilang,

744
01:13:45,333 --> 01:13:48,500
tanganku mungkin tak bisa seperti dulu.

745
01:13:55,875 --> 01:13:58,250
Kenapa kau memindahkan barangmu?

746
01:14:00,458 --> 01:14:04,458
Azam, kurasa ini waktunya
aku berhenti jadi mekanik.

747
01:14:04,541 --> 01:14:07,375
Semalam aku meneleponmu. Kau tak menjawab.

748
01:14:11,083 --> 01:14:13,708
Jet. Di mana Jimmy?

749
01:14:15,291 --> 01:14:17,166
Boy menyerbu rumah Jimmy.

750
01:14:17,250 --> 01:14:19,208
Motornya dibakar.

751
01:14:19,291 --> 01:14:21,250
Ibunya sudah kembali ke desa.

752
01:14:21,750 --> 01:14:24,083
Dia babak belur.

753
01:14:24,791 --> 01:14:25,833
Boy?

754
01:14:27,625 --> 01:14:28,708
Kenapa?

755
01:14:29,250 --> 01:14:31,916
Kau mau ke mana? Balas dendam?

756
01:14:32,916 --> 01:14:35,333
Kau juga ingin jadi orang cacat?
Seperti Arash?

757
01:14:40,833 --> 01:14:41,916
Jet.

758
01:14:45,125 --> 01:14:46,375
Kurasa…

759
01:14:47,541 --> 01:14:50,291
sebaiknya kau tetap bersama pacarmu saja.

760
01:14:51,375 --> 01:14:54,083
Kau suka menghancurkan hidup orang, 'kan?

761
01:15:30,250 --> 01:15:31,291
Azam.

762
01:15:36,875 --> 01:15:38,041
Kenapa kau diam saja?

763
01:15:38,875 --> 01:15:40,583
Kau tak mau berteman denganku lagi?

764
01:15:41,166 --> 01:15:42,208
Tidak.

765
01:15:43,291 --> 01:15:44,250
Tidak.

766
01:15:49,166 --> 01:15:50,541
Hanya saja Arash…

767
01:15:52,125 --> 01:15:53,583
Arash meninggal.

768
01:15:56,125 --> 01:15:59,333
Ratna, kau tak perlu datang
mencariku lagi.

769
01:16:00,666 --> 01:16:02,416
Kau bahkan tak perlu meneleponku.

770
01:16:03,916 --> 01:16:06,791
Pembalap jalanan sepertiku
hanya akan mempersulit hidupmu.

771
01:16:10,875 --> 01:16:11,916
Betulkah?

772
01:16:12,916 --> 01:16:14,250
Itu yang kau pikirkan.

773
01:16:15,083 --> 01:16:17,208
Kapan kau pernah mempersulit hidupku?

774
01:16:18,875 --> 01:16:20,625
Dengarkan saja aku, Ratna.

775
01:16:23,291 --> 01:16:24,916
Kau masih muda.

776
01:16:26,291 --> 01:16:27,458
Dan kau cantik.

777
01:16:29,541 --> 01:16:31,833
Cepat atau lambat, kau akan melupakanku.

778
01:16:55,958 --> 01:16:57,333
Aku tak akan pernah lupa.

779
01:17:11,416 --> 01:17:12,708
Ingatlah ini, Ratna.

780
01:17:15,583 --> 01:17:17,250
Aku akan melupakanmu.

781
01:19:17,500 --> 01:19:18,791
Sedang apa kau di sini?

782
01:19:27,458 --> 01:19:30,875
Kau tidak pantas hidup.

783
01:19:30,958 --> 01:19:32,833
Jimmy, santai.

784
01:19:33,708 --> 01:19:36,750
Aku harus menjaga harga diri.
Anak buahku yang mau memukulimu.

785
01:19:36,833 --> 01:19:37,958
Aku bisa apa?

786
01:19:38,458 --> 01:19:40,958
Jimmy, tenanglah.

787
01:19:41,458 --> 01:19:43,875
Baiklah. Kau mau berapa?
Aku akan membayarmu.

788
01:19:46,958 --> 01:19:48,791
<i>Sampaikan salamku pada sahabatmu.</i>

789
01:19:50,375 --> 01:19:51,375
<i>Lihat baik-baik.</i>

790
01:20:13,166 --> 01:20:14,333
Jangan.

791
01:22:20,166 --> 01:22:21,375
Ratna.

792
01:22:22,791 --> 01:22:24,875
Aku tahu kau membenciku.

793
01:22:24,958 --> 01:22:27,958
Tapi bisakah kau tunggu
dan dengarkan aku dulu?

794
01:22:30,875 --> 01:22:31,833
Asalamualaikum.

795
01:22:31,916 --> 01:22:33,333
Alaikum salam. Masuklah.

796
01:22:34,291 --> 01:22:35,375
Ratna.

797
01:22:36,833 --> 01:22:38,250
Kau sehat?

798
01:22:38,333 --> 01:22:40,416
Ratna, namaku Sarah.

799
01:22:41,208 --> 01:22:42,875
Lukisanmu sangat indah.

800
01:22:42,958 --> 01:22:45,208
Aku kenal pemilik galeri.

801
01:22:45,291 --> 01:22:49,750
Di sana ada banyak karya seni
yang dibuat oleh orang-orang sepertimu.

802
01:22:49,833 --> 01:22:52,958
Di sana juga ada sekolah seni.

803
01:22:53,041 --> 01:22:55,458
Kau bisa belajar melukis,

804
01:22:55,541 --> 01:22:57,583
lalu kau bisa menjual semua lukisanmu.

805
01:23:00,083 --> 01:23:01,708
Sudah cukuplah, Ratna.

806
01:23:03,833 --> 01:23:05,458
Apa kau tak sayang padaku?

807
01:23:39,916 --> 01:23:41,333
Hei!

808
01:23:41,958 --> 01:23:43,333
Bukankah ini motornya Boy?

809
01:23:43,833 --> 01:23:45,500
Katakan. Ini motor Boy, 'kan?

810
01:23:45,583 --> 01:23:47,125
Apa yang kau lakukan padanya?

811
01:23:47,208 --> 01:23:49,625
Jangan sampai aku lapor polisi!

812
01:23:53,791 --> 01:23:55,000
Teman-Teman!

813
01:24:00,166 --> 01:24:03,625
Siapa pun yang bisa
menghancurkan wajah pria ini,

814
01:24:04,833 --> 01:24:06,875
akan kuberi hadiah RM5.000!

815
01:24:07,541 --> 01:24:09,083
Ya!

816
01:24:16,750 --> 01:24:17,750
Kalian terima?

817
01:24:23,458 --> 01:24:24,333
Hei, serius?

818
01:24:26,083 --> 01:24:27,375
Kita berteman!

819
01:24:29,416 --> 01:24:32,791
Hei, kita semua berteman.
Apa kalian sudah lupa?

820
01:25:09,041 --> 01:25:10,416
Terima kasih.

821
01:25:17,125 --> 01:25:18,250
Azam!

822
01:25:19,333 --> 01:25:20,416
Azam!

823
01:25:31,500 --> 01:25:32,916
Sedang apa kau di sini?

824
01:25:35,208 --> 01:25:38,333
Besok pagi, Ayah mau aku ikut dengannya.

825
01:25:41,583 --> 01:25:42,416
Itu bagus.

826
01:25:42,500 --> 01:25:44,500
Tapi aku tak mau pergi.

827
01:25:45,958 --> 01:25:47,791
Jangan melakukan hal bodoh.

828
01:25:51,250 --> 01:25:52,625
Ada apa denganmu?

829
01:25:52,708 --> 01:25:54,625
Hari itu kau baik-baik saja.

830
01:25:58,166 --> 01:25:59,416
Azam.

831
01:26:00,916 --> 01:26:02,500
Kau tahu yang mau kukatakan, 'kan?

832
01:26:03,666 --> 01:26:06,583
- Azam, aku…
- Ratna, tak usah membicarakan ini.

833
01:26:24,375 --> 01:26:25,666
Tetaplah di dalam, ya?

834
01:26:50,750 --> 01:26:52,083
Kau dari mana, Jimmy?

835
01:27:09,541 --> 01:27:10,750
Ya…

836
01:27:12,833 --> 01:27:14,750
Kau menjemput wanita difabel?

837
01:27:16,125 --> 01:27:18,166
Apa kau tak punya simpati pada ibumu?

838
01:27:18,250 --> 01:27:20,333
Apa urusanmu?

839
01:27:20,416 --> 01:27:24,708
Mat Jet dan aku bekerja keras
di tempat ini, kau tak pernah peduli.

840
01:27:25,708 --> 01:27:27,375
Banyak yang terjadi, Jimmy.

841
01:27:28,333 --> 01:27:29,750
Kau mau aku berbuat apa?

842
01:27:32,500 --> 01:27:33,833
Kau mencuri motornya Boy.

843
01:27:35,208 --> 01:27:37,125
Kau bergaul dengan orang-orang sampah.

844
01:27:37,208 --> 01:27:40,250
- Apa yang mau kau lakukan?
- Sampah?

845
01:27:40,750 --> 01:27:43,458
Mereka mungkin sampah,
tapi mereka menghormatiku.

846
01:27:44,541 --> 01:27:46,125
Apa yang coba kau buktikan?

847
01:27:48,125 --> 01:27:50,250
- Bahwa kau berkuasa?
- Memang.

848
01:27:52,000 --> 01:27:54,500
Malam ini. Jalan yang sama.

849
01:27:54,583 --> 01:27:56,708
Aku tak mau balapan denganmu!

850
01:27:57,958 --> 01:27:59,750
Dulu kau mungkin meremehkanku.

851
01:28:00,833 --> 01:28:03,125
Kalau kau tak mau balapan denganku,

852
01:28:06,875 --> 01:28:09,000
aku akan membuatnya bisu.

853
01:28:09,750 --> 01:28:10,791
Kau terima tantangannya?

854
01:28:12,250 --> 01:28:13,250
Hei!

855
01:28:13,333 --> 01:28:16,916
Kau sentuh dia, akan kuhancurkan wajahmu.

856
01:28:18,625 --> 01:28:19,458
Ya?

857
01:28:19,541 --> 01:28:20,791
Kau mau balapan?

858
01:28:21,875 --> 01:28:25,083
Kalau kau kalah, kembalilah pada ibumu.

859
01:28:26,041 --> 01:28:27,500
Dan kalau kau kalah?

860
01:28:28,000 --> 01:28:30,875
Bakar motormu dan cium kakiku.

861
01:28:31,458 --> 01:28:32,625
Ya?

862
01:28:34,666 --> 01:28:36,500
Kalau itu bisa memuaskanmu…

863
01:28:38,000 --> 01:28:39,333
Baiklah.

864
01:28:59,875 --> 01:29:01,916
Kau lihat seperti apa kehidupanku, 'kan?

865
01:29:03,666 --> 01:29:04,833
Pulanglah.

866
01:29:07,458 --> 01:29:08,500
Pergi.

867
01:29:43,208 --> 01:29:44,625
Ada apa, Ratna?

868
01:29:54,875 --> 01:29:55,958
Ratna.

869
01:29:57,333 --> 01:30:00,291
Apa ini tentang pria bodoh itu,
lupakan saja dia.

870
01:30:02,916 --> 01:30:04,375
- Ratna…
- Diam.

871
01:30:24,500 --> 01:30:26,625
Kapan aku bisa masuk sekolah seni?

872
01:30:31,583 --> 01:30:33,166
Kapan pun kau mau.

873
01:30:34,041 --> 01:30:35,250
Secepatnya.

874
01:31:02,458 --> 01:31:03,666
Apa kau ingat?

875
01:31:05,083 --> 01:31:06,833
Pulang sekolah kita selalu balapan.

876
01:31:08,791 --> 01:31:09,958
Terkadang kau menang.

877
01:31:11,416 --> 01:31:12,708
Terkadang aku menang.

878
01:31:16,583 --> 01:31:18,666
Kita tak harus
melakukan balapan bodoh ini.

879
01:31:23,500 --> 01:31:24,541
Kenapa?

880
01:31:27,666 --> 01:31:29,041
Orang yang kau sukai pergi?

881
01:31:37,875 --> 01:31:38,916
Oke?

882
01:31:44,375 --> 01:31:45,416
Oke?

883
01:31:47,666 --> 01:31:49,791
Balapan hari ini "Matca Orisinal".

884
01:31:55,583 --> 01:31:56,666
Siap!

885
01:32:03,041 --> 01:32:04,166
Maju!

886
01:35:11,166 --> 01:35:12,333
Jimmy?

887
01:35:14,500 --> 01:35:16,125
Azam.

888
01:35:16,208 --> 01:35:18,625
Jimmy, kau baik-baik saja?

889
01:35:20,666 --> 01:35:21,541
Jimmy!

890
01:35:33,458 --> 01:35:34,875
Jimmy!

891
01:35:38,250 --> 01:35:39,250
Jimmy?

892
01:35:42,000 --> 01:35:42,875
Jimmy?

893
01:35:44,291 --> 01:35:45,875
- Mobilku.
- Tahan, Jimmy.

894
01:35:46,916 --> 01:35:50,333
Ingat Allah. Sudah kubilang, Jimmy.

895
01:35:50,416 --> 01:35:53,291
Kenapa kau harus melakukan hal bodoh ini?

896
01:35:56,083 --> 01:35:58,208
Aku ingin jadi sepertimu.

897
01:35:59,750 --> 01:36:02,541
Itu tidak perlu, Jimmy.

898
01:36:03,041 --> 01:36:04,208
Panggil ambulans!

899
01:36:04,791 --> 01:36:06,458
Ambulans apa? Panggil polisi!

900
01:36:06,541 --> 01:36:08,166
Biar mampus temanmu itu!

901
01:36:10,333 --> 01:36:14,500
Maafkan aku, Azam.

902
01:36:15,000 --> 01:36:18,625
Harusnya aku yang minta maaf.
Aku berbuat banyak salah padamu.

903
01:36:18,708 --> 01:36:19,791
Jimmy.

904
01:36:22,083 --> 01:36:25,166
Kau tak perlu bicara. Diamlah saja, Jimmy.

905
01:36:25,250 --> 01:36:26,625
Pergilah, Azam.

906
01:36:26,708 --> 01:36:29,375
Aku tak akan pergi, Jimmy.

907
01:36:29,458 --> 01:36:32,166
- Aku tak akan pergi.
- Pergilah!

908
01:36:32,250 --> 01:36:33,583
Hei!

909
01:36:34,708 --> 01:36:36,583
Hei, kau mau ke mana?

910
01:36:37,416 --> 01:36:39,583
Panggil polisi. Cepat panggil polisi.

911
01:36:40,416 --> 01:36:41,750
Pergi!

912
01:36:41,833 --> 01:36:43,416
Panggil polisi sekarang!

913
01:36:44,000 --> 01:36:45,000
Jimmy?

914
01:36:45,083 --> 01:36:46,875
Pergi, Azam!

915
01:36:51,291 --> 01:36:52,541
Halo, Pak.

916
01:36:53,041 --> 01:36:54,500
Ada pembalap jalanan kecelakaan.

917
01:37:13,791 --> 01:37:16,458
- Hei!
- Kembali!

918
01:37:16,541 --> 01:37:17,458
Hei!

919
01:38:09,166 --> 01:38:10,125
Ratna.

920
01:38:11,958 --> 01:38:14,750
Kau tidak akan sendiri lagi, ya?

921
01:38:21,291 --> 01:38:22,458
Azam.

922
01:38:23,500 --> 01:38:24,541
Azam?

923
01:38:26,458 --> 01:38:27,791
Azam?

924
01:38:30,333 --> 01:38:31,250
Ratna.

925
01:38:34,041 --> 01:38:35,000
Ratna.

926
01:38:36,625 --> 01:38:37,708
Maafkan aku.

927
01:38:39,708 --> 01:38:42,625
Aku tak bermaksud
bicara begitu padamu pada hari itu.

928
01:38:48,916 --> 01:38:50,208
Kau bohong, 'kan?

929
01:38:50,833 --> 01:38:52,750
Kau tak akan meninggalkanku, 'kan?

930
01:38:56,041 --> 01:38:57,416
Aku bohong.

931
01:38:59,708 --> 01:39:01,125
Sudah kuduga.

932
01:39:02,583 --> 01:39:05,958
Kau juga bohong
soal kembali ke kampung halamanmu.

933
01:39:08,458 --> 01:39:10,041
Kau bohong, 'kan?

934
01:39:14,666 --> 01:39:15,708
Azam?

935
01:39:18,333 --> 01:39:19,625
Tapi kenapa, Azam?

936
01:39:21,166 --> 01:39:23,958
- Kenapa kau mau meninggalkanku?
- Ratna…

937
01:39:26,375 --> 01:39:27,833
Kalau aku…

938
01:39:30,333 --> 01:39:32,000
Kalau pembalap jalanan sepertiku…

939
01:39:34,333 --> 01:39:36,583
sampah masyarakat sepertiku…

940
01:39:39,666 --> 01:39:41,166
bersama denganmu,

941
01:39:42,250 --> 01:39:44,041
hidupmu tidak akan maju.

942
01:39:44,125 --> 01:39:47,083
Apa maksudmu, Azam?

943
01:39:47,166 --> 01:39:49,583
Ratna, pergilah.

944
01:39:51,583 --> 01:39:52,833
Pergi saja.

945
01:40:03,333 --> 01:40:05,041
Jangan berhenti melukis.

946
01:40:07,125 --> 01:40:08,500
Dengarkan aku.

947
01:40:11,208 --> 01:40:12,666
Lupakanlah aku.

948
01:40:15,333 --> 01:40:16,541
Lupakan aku.

949
01:41:19,875 --> 01:41:21,458
Aku tak akan melupakanmu, Azam.

950
01:43:26,250 --> 01:43:28,541
SELAMAT DATANG DI PERLIS

951
01:44:21,375 --> 01:44:22,666
Kau mau menjual motor ini?

952
01:44:30,791 --> 01:44:32,583
Rawat ini baik-baik, ya?

953
01:44:37,958 --> 01:44:39,000
Terima kasih.

954
01:44:58,125 --> 01:44:59,708
<i>Jaga tempat ini dengan baik, Jet.</i>

955
01:45:05,041 --> 01:45:06,291
<i>Kejarlah mimpimu.</i>

956
01:45:22,666 --> 01:45:24,458
MAT JET MOTORSPORT
SEGERA DIBUKA

957
01:45:32,833 --> 01:45:34,625
Ini galeri kami.

958
01:45:34,708 --> 01:45:38,666
Kami menampilkan karya seni
dari orang-orang istimewa sepertimu.

959
01:45:39,500 --> 01:45:42,666
Kami membingkai
semua karya senimu di sini.

960
01:45:43,166 --> 01:45:44,833
Kau sangat berbakat.

961
01:45:49,125 --> 01:45:50,583
Kenapa bingkai ini kosong?

962
01:45:53,833 --> 01:45:56,041
Karena lukisannya tidak ada di sini.

963
01:46:06,916 --> 01:46:08,458
Apa judul lukisannya?

964
01:46:16,250 --> 01:46:17,958
ORISINAL

965
01:46:50,958 --> 01:46:52,333
<i>"Malaikat Malam".</i>

966
01:50:59,000 --> 01:51:01,041
FILM KARYA NAZIFDIN NASRUDIN
INI ADALAH KARYA FIKSI

967
01:51:01,125 --> 01:51:03,041
KESAMAAN DENGAN ORGANISASI ATAU ORANG
HANYA KEBETULAN SEMATA

968
01:51:03,125 --> 01:51:04,708
Terjemahan subtitle oleh Nur Cholis